s with other players and set your imagination free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/steam_Conquer_the_night_in_survival_mode_Center.png?t=1746715910\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test yourself in a challenging survival mode, where every night brings new, growing terrors. Survive the onslaught, and rebuild every morning to face the undead hordes again. Fight until you win glory\u2026 or reprieve in death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/extras/Darfall_SteamStore_GIF_04.gif?t=1746715910\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["SquareNite"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961600/a1ad51bf59ae9035dae816886000e7ea2faff8fb/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1746715910","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Paradox Interactive AB. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136550,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136550/movie480.mp4?t=1746715744","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136550/movie_max.mp4?t=1746715744"},"name":"Relese Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136550/843eae7d9de5ae3d8e63ce38aa60ac2940596ded/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746715744","